in their view on what's going on. They could almost come across as being a bit delusional in what they think someone else is thinking about them in the absence of any good evidence. And so that has made people think this looks like psychosis, but it isn't really psychosis. and it certainly doesn't respond to antipsychotics like schizophrenia with, but it's not as mild as neurosis where there is a good sort of reality testing

