00:29:07.000 --> 00:29:48.000
We're going to have guests coming over in a few moments. Can I ask you that you put your shoes away? So you can see that took longer, 100% longer than can you please put your shoes away. But when you're dealing with a child with a sensitive temperament, you're going to have to slow down. and you're going to have to build into your schedule time to create an environment that doesn't feel invalidating to the young person. Of course, with the necessary balance as well, you can't have a laissez-faire environment either where anything goes. You'll have to just work really hard as a parent to get the balance right between I'm

